{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03934","headline":"奉和送金城公主适西蕃应制 · 唐远悊","name":"奉和送金城公主适西蕃应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇恩睠下人，割爱远和亲。\n少女风游兑，姮娥月去秦。\n龙笛迎金榜，骊歌送锦轮。\n那堪桃李色，移向虏庭春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐远悊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}